    },
    {
      "number": 2127,
      "text": "That will be their recompense because they rejected Our verses and said, “What! When we are turned into bones and crumbled particles, will we really be raised as a new creation?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
