      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2128,
      "text": "Do they not see that Allah, Who created the heavens and earth, is able to create the like of them? He has decreed for them an appointed time, about which there is no doubt, yet the wrongdoers persist in denial.",
